  "name": "Clementine and Vanilla Porridge with Citrus Salsa",
  "subtitle": "Warm vanilla oats topped with chilled citrus, mint, seeds, and yogurt.",
  "description": "Prepare a bright clementine and grapefruit salsa while the vanilla porridge cooks, then finish each serving with yogurt, toasted-style seeds, and walnuts.",
